            <title>[LU-20216] rustreapi: cleanup version cfgs </title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20216</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Support for older versions is limited to last release of version. More find-grained versioning would require symbol-level features which I would prefer to do as needed going forward. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also included in this is conversion of from `bitmask_enum` to `bitflags!`. The former didn't support `#&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;cfg&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;` on individual variants. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
